r secure HTTPS connections.\r\n   Remediation: Add 'Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload' to response headers.\r\n\r\n4. [LOW] Missing Frame Protection (Clickjacking Risk)\r\n   Location:    Global / Header\r\n   Description: Site lacks X-Frame-Options or CSP frame-ancestors. An attacker can embed your app in an invisible iframe.\r\n   Remediation: Set 'X-Frame-Options: DENY' or 'frame-ancestors none' in your response headers.\r\n\r\n5. [LOW] Missing X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff\r\n   Location:    Global / Header\r\n   Description: Without 'nosniff', browsers may MIME-sniff responses away from the declared content type.\r\n   Remediation: Add 'X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff' header.\r\n\r\n6. [LOW] Missing Referrer-Policy Header\r\n   Location:    Global / Header\r\n   Description: Without a strict Referrer-Policy, internal URLs with tokens or sensitive query params can leak in referrer headers.\r\n   Remediation: Set 'Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin' header.\r\n\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------\r\n💡 Run with --prompt to generate ready-to-paste AI fix prompts.\r\n\r\n--- COPY-PASTE AI REMEDIATION PROMPT ---\r\nFix the following security vulnerabilities in this project:\r\n- [CRITICAL] Unencrypted HTTP Connection in None: Enforce SSL/TLS redirection at CDN or hosting level (e.g. Vercel, Cloudflare, Netlify).\r\n- [LOW] Missing Content-Security-Policy (CSP) in None: Configure a Content-Security-Policy header in your next.config.js, middleware, or reverse proxy.\r\n- [LOW] Missing Strict-Transport-Security (HSTS) in None: Add 'Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload' to response headers.\r\n- [LOW] Missing Frame Protection (Clickjacking Risk) in None: Set 'X-Frame-Options: DENY' or 'frame-ancestors none' in your response headers.\r\n- [LOW] Missing X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff in None: Add 'X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff' header.\r\n- [LOW] Missing Referrer-Policy Header in None: Set 'Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin' header.\r\n\n"}
